?TACL MACRO
== ==================================================================
== EMSERR - egy nap EMS esemenyei kozott hibauzenetek keresese
==
== Hasznalat:
==   LOAD /KEEP 1/ $DATA.EMSRPT.EMSERR
==   EMSERR                 == tegnapi nap
==   EMSERR 2026-11-15      == adott nap
==
== Mukodes:
==   1. Az EMSDIST printing distributor a $0 collector logjaibol
==      (ZZEVnnnn, 843-as kodu fajlok) szovegge alakitja a nap esemenyeit
==      egy munkafajlba (TIME/STOP: a nap eleje es vege).
==   2. Az EMSSCAN program ebben keresi a hibara utalo esemenyeket, es
==      a riportot a spoolerbe irja ($S.#EMSERR).
==
== A munkafajl helyet (ef) es a collectort (coll) ird at a sajatodra.
== ==================================================================
?SECTION emserr MACRO
#FRAME
#PUSH ef coll nap ts dt jd yy mo dd
#SET ef   $DATA.EMSRPT.EMSTXT      == munkafajl (felulirodik)
#SET coll $0                       == EMS collector

== nap: parameter, vagy ha nincs megadva, a tegnapi nap (yyyy-mm-dd)
#SET nap %1%
[#IF [#EMPTYV nap] |THEN|
  #SET ts [#JULIANTIMESTAMP]
  #SET ts [#COMPUTE ts - 86400000000]
  #SET dt [#INTERPRETTIMESTAMP [ts]]
  SINK [#SETMANY jd yy mo dd , [dt]]
  [#IF mo < 10 |THEN| #SET mo 0[mo]]
  [#IF dd < 10 |THEN| #SET dd 0[dd]]
  #SET nap [yy]-[mo]-[dd]
]

#OUTPUT EMSERR: [nap] 00:00:00 - 23:59:59, collector [coll]
#OUTPUT EMSERR: munkafajl [ef]

== munkafajl ujra letrehozasa (entry-sequenced szovegsorok)
[#IF [#FILEINFO /EXISTENCE/ [ef]] |THEN| FUP PURGE [ef]!]
FUP CREATE [ef], TYPE E, REC 200, EXT (200,200), MAXEXTENTS 500

== 1. EMS log -> szoveg (a STOP idopontnal az EMSDIST magatol leall)
EMSDIST /NAME/ TYPE PRINTING, COLLECTOR [coll], TEXTOUT [ef], &
  TIME [nap] 00:00:00, STOP [nap] 23:59:59

== 2. hibakereses, riport a spoolerbe
RUN EMSSCAN /OUT $S.#EMSERR/ [ef]
#OUTPUT EMSERR: kesz, riport: $S.#EMSERR
#UNFRAME
